# PAM stack for the videonode-session helper (web Basic-Auth verification).
# Installed to /etc/pam.d/videonode. Target: Debian trixie.
#
# The pam_succeed_if gate mirrors the daemon's Go-side videonode-group check:
# the helper is setuid root and executable by anyone, so without this gate it
# would act as a password oracle for arbitrary local accounts. With it, the
# helper only ever verifies passwords of accounts that may log in anyway.
auth      requisite   pam_succeed_if.so quiet user ingroup videonode
@include common-auth
@include common-account
